==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Literally “for what”, from {{m|sh|za||for}} + {{m|sh|štȍ||what}}. For the conjunction compare {{m|sh|zato što}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sh-IPA|zȁšto}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|za|što}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=zȁšto}}

# [[why]], [[what for]]
#:{{uxi|sh|zašto (da) ne?|why not?}}
#:{{uxi|sh|zašto to?|why so? why is that?}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|why}} {{l|sh|štȍ}}

===Conjunction===
{{sh-conjunction|head=zȁšto}}

# {{lb|sh|archaic}} [[because]]

====Synonyms====
